From {{der|fo|non|ríkr}}, from {{der|fo|gem-pro|*rīkijaz}}, a derivative of {{m|gem-pro|*rīks||king, ruler}}, itself a borrowing from {{der|fo|cel-pro|*rīxs}}, from {{der|fo|ine-pro|*h₃rḗǵs}}, from {{der|fo|ine-pro|*h₃reǵ-}}

===Adjective===
